{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Keep referenced payloads inside the retained-size budget.** These types receive only shallow sizing, but a `slice` can hold arbitrary objects. For example, a custom-renderable `slice(bytearray(20_000_000), None)` is admitted as tiny and preserved verbatim, defeating the 16 MB bound and risking Lambda OOM. Traverse owned fields/referents or reject these types, with an over-budget custom-renderer test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7s713E","finding_digest":"ea6c1cf3405a9df9ac9ecf0e969171cbe08e51ef48754894a52ee1a6db3c26bc","finding_id":"arf_v1_5jwbz42alko7tle6z4hjnelrzp","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane._pending::unbounded-record-bytes","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane._pending::unbounded-record-bytes","line":69,"observation_digest":"b8ff3c2c5e7bc4c97deb6e96eda3a16e62241708cd2cb226b9226870e08679bb","observation_id":"aro_v1_xd7tylc6ppcms7pln2lo3i5bnz","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5jwbz42alko7tle6z4hjnelrzp","published_at":"2026-09-10T03:12:21Z","review_id":"arr_v1_xu5asg75ee3ff5ephagorp56ks","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"3a78affbb4beb7c25b916c32f6a9d81bd33f714e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":65,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_jet4wvxmqzxwjikggb3dkkvyif","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T03:12:21Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
